OL,3,GNEWSASchools report early impact of
OL,4,Asmartphone ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in Kent and Sussex say they are
OL,7,Falready seeing changes in pupil
OL,8,Fbehaviour a month after a nationwide
OL,9,Fban on smartphones came into force.
OL,11,FThe policy, announced in June and
OL,12,Fintroduced at the start of the school
OL,13,Fyear, restricts students' use of
OL,14,Fsmartphones during the school day.
OL,16,FIn a joint letter to parents, secondary
OL,17,Fschool heads in Brighton & Hove
OL,18,Fpreviously asked parents not to send
OL,19,FYear 7 pupils to their new school with
OL,20,Fa smartphone.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
