OL,3,GNEWSASchools report early impact of
OL,4,Asmartphone ban
OL,5,
OL,6,FShelley Baker, head teacher at Varndean
OL,7,FSchool in the city, said: "Young
OL,8,Fpeople, especially in the older years,
OL,9,Fare recognising the dangers and damages
OL,10,Fthat smartphones have already done to
OL,11,Fthem."
